## Verdict

- Novel peptides (1% class FDR): model **420** vs null **374** across 12 populations.
- PC-churn: canonical PSMs 3,284,622 (baseline) -> 3,262,199 (model, -22,423) -> 3,221,135 (null, -63,487). The null DB displaces 41,064 MORE canonical PSMs than the model DB.
- Net PSM: model 3,265,465 vs null 3,232,585.

